    <string name="main_list_father_card">"Fathers are the silent heroes of the family. They support us with their strength and raise us with their love. Thank you for being our first and eternal heroes!"</string>
    <string name="main_list_mother_card">"Mom, you are the purest form of love and care. Your place in our lives is indescribable because you are our first teacher, strongest supporter, and an endless source of love. Happy Mother’s Day, sunshine of our lives!"</string>
    <string name="main_list_lover_card">"My love, you are the most beautiful gift that gives meaning to my life. In a world lit by your eyes, every moment becomes more special and unforgettable. Happy Valentine’s Day — the most beautiful place in my heart belongs to you!"</string>
    <string name="main_list_women_card">"Women are the real heroes who add color and meaning to the world. With their strength, love, and unique presence, they make every moment more beautiful. Happy Women’s Day to all who make life better!"</string>

